  SentinelPay — A fraud detection engine built from first principles.
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

I built SentinelPay to understand how real financial systems make hard decisions
quickly and correctly — risk scoring, ML lifecycle management, analyst workflows,
and the event-driven architecture that ties all of it together.

What started as an academic exercise became something I'm genuinely proud of.
If it's useful to you — whether you're learning, building something of your own,
or just exploring how fraud detection systems are designed — take it. That's the
point.

All I ask is this: if you use SentinelPay as a foundation for something that
protects real people from financial harm, I'd genuinely love to hear about it.

— Teboho Mokoni, Cape Town, South Africa

